            {
              "id": "nist-ai-rmf.govern-1-1",
              "name": "NistAiRmfGovern11",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GOVERN 1.1 — legal and regulatory requirements are understood and documented"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Legal and regulatory requirements involving AI are understood, managed, and documented."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Legal and regulatory requirements involving AI are understood, managed, and documented.\n\nRecord which regimes apply and why — one page naming the instruments, your role under each, and the obligations that bind today versus later.\n\nNIST AI RMF GOVERN 1.1 — Legal and regulatory requirements involving AI are understood, managed, and documented.: https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework",
                "markdown": "**GOVERN 1.1 — legal and regulatory requirements are understood and documented**\nLegal and regulatory requirements involving AI are understood, managed, and documented.\n**How to close it:** Record which regimes apply and why — one page naming the instruments, your role under each, and the obligations that bind today versus later.\n**Citations**\n- [NIST AI RMF GOVERN 1.1 — Legal and regulatory requirements involving AI are understood, managed, and documented.](https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework)\n_In force from 2023-01-26._"
