              "name": "NistAiRmfMeasure27",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "MEASURE 2.7 — security and resilience are evaluated"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "AI system security and resilience are evaluated and documented. For a system built on a language model this means the AI-specific attack surface: prompt injection, jailbreaks, model evasion and data exfiltration through the model, not only the surrounding web application."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "AI system security and resilience are evaluated and documented. For a system built on a language model this means the AI-specific attack surface: prompt injection, jailbreaks, model evasion and data exfiltration through the model, not only the surrounding web application.\n\nAdd input and output moderation on the model path and an adversarial test suite.\n\nNIST AI RMF MEASURE 2.7 — AI system security and resilience are evaluated and documented.: https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework",
                "markdown": "**MEASURE 2.7 — security and resilience are evaluated**\nAI system security and resilience are evaluated and documented. For a system built on a language model this means the AI-specific attack surface: prompt injection, jailbreaks, model evasion and data exfiltration through the model, not only the surrounding web application.\n**How to close it:** Add input and output moderation on the model path and an adversarial test suite.\n**Citations**\n- [NIST AI RMF MEASURE 2.7 — AI system security and resilience are evaluated and documented.](https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework)\n_In force from 2023-01-26._"
