          "message": {
            "text": "Deployer duties: assigned overseers, input data, and telling the workforce: This system makes decisions about people at work, and nothing records that workers or their representatives were informed before it was put into service. Article 26(7) is a duty on the employer and it is easy to miss because it sits outside the technical requirements: before a high-risk system is used at the workplace, the affected workers and their representatives have to be told. Record when, and to whom."
